        card("Activity 11: role play with a host family", "You are a foreign language student staying with a Filipino host family; ask about the typical weather and use honorifics. Student A: it is 7:00 a.m., greet the host family; say you could hardly sleep because it was raining hard and the thunder and lightning were so loud, and that you are scared of them; say you and your classmates plan to go swimming at a beach in Subic the next day, Saturday, and ask if it is a good time to travel; say you will call your classmates to cancel. Student B: return the greetings; say June is the start of the rainy season and even typhoons and that thunder and lightning are pretty normal; say Subic is just four hours away, but if it is raining heavily the roads may be flooded in Manila and the north expressway may be too slippery; say to cancel the trip instead and wait for further weather updates. A sample:", examples=dlg(_HF)),
